Implemented optional position jitter and background noise in the generate postprocess with deterministic RNG, safe r/theta handling, plus default config wiring and targeted tests.

Skills used: S20_HYDRA_CONFIG (new noise config group), S60_EVALUATION_QC (variance/particle-count checks), S98_GOVERNANCE (added tests); S30_PLUGIN_EXTENSION not used because no new plugin was added.
- `src/synthlab/domains/wafer_particles/noise.py` adds jitter/background helpers with r clamping and theta normalization.
- `src/synthlab/processes/generate.py` reads `wafer_particles.noise`, applies jitter/background per sample before size model, and uses per-sample seeded RNG.
- `conf/wafer_particles/noise/default.yaml` defines noise defaults (OFF); `conf/process/generate.yaml` includes the group.
- `tests/test_T0106_noise_jitter_and_background.py` validates variance increase with jitter, particle count increase with background, and seed reproducibility.

